{"abstract":[{"text":"Install the bundled ","type":"text"},{"code":"swidux-ref","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" skill so your AI coding assistant has Swidux’s architecture rules and code templates on hand.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill (","type":"text"},{"code":"swidux-ref","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill is published in ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","type":"reference"},{"text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SKILL.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-patterns.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppState"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppAction"},{"type":"text","text":", reducers, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStore"},{"type":"text","text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Installing the skill","anchor":"Installing-the-skill","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Requires "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gh"},{"type":"text","text":" ≥ v2.90.0 ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/cli.github.com","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["gh skill install heirloomlogic\/skills swidux-ref --agent claude-code --scope user"],"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--scope user"},{"text":" installs to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"~\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/"},{"text":" (loads in every project).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--scope project"},{"text":" installs to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<cwd>\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/"},{"text":" (commit it so the whole team gets it).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pin a version with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref@v1.2.3"},{"text":". List tags with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"git ls-remote --tags https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Other agents: pass ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--agent codex"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--agent cursor"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--agent gemini-cli"},{"text":", etc. Run ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gh skill install --help"},{"text":" for the full list.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":3,"text":"skills.sh","anchor":"skillssh","type":"heading"},{"code":["npx skillsadd heirloomlogic\/skills"],"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indexes the same source repo. Works without a GitHub CLI install."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Manual-no-gh-no-npx","level":3,"text":"Manual (no `gh`, no `npx`)"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","t